	\operatorname{diag}(\operatorname{ev}_{x_{1}}(f),\ldots,\operatorname{ev}_{x_{t}}(f))=f_{i}(y)=\operatorname{diag}(\operatorname{ev}_{z_{1}}(f),\ldots,\operatorname{ev}_{z_{s}}(f)).
