\label{bandwidth}
Given a matrix $D\in M_{n}$, we let 
$$
\mathfrak{r}(D):=\min\{m\geq 0:D_{i,j}=0\text{ whenever }|i-j|\geq m\}
$$ 
if it exists, and $\mathfrak{r}(D):= n$ otherwise, and we call this number the \textit{bandwidth} of $D$.

