	U[\gamma^{n}_{1,n}]^{N}U[\sigma^{n}_{t-1,n}]=U[\gamma^{n}_{1,t-1}]^{N}U[\gamma^{n}_{t,n}]^{N}.
\end{equation}
By \autoref{commuting perms}, it is elementary to see that \autoref{elementary} holds. Therefore, for the remainder of the proof, we may assume that $t-2\geq N$. 

For any $N\leq k\leq t-1-N$, we may apply \autoref{factormain} (recalling that $t-1\leq n-N$) to conclude that
\begin{equation}
