$$
\prod_{k=p_{m}}^{(p_{m+1}-1)-M}\prod_{t=1}^{M-1}u_{(k \ k+t)}^{i}(\Theta_{i_{m}}(x_{m})_{k-p_{m}+1,k-p_{m}+1}\Delta_{i_{m}}'(x_{m})_{k-p_{m}+1+t,k-p_{m}+1+t}),
