Fix $1\leq i\leq  l $ and $x\in X_{i}$. From \autoref{Wn}, we have
\begin{equation}
\label{fV}
\begin{aligned}
(fV)_{i}(x)&=f_{i}(x)W_{n_{i}}(\Theta_{i}(x)_{1,1},\ldots,\Theta_{i}(x)_{n_{i},n_{i}})\\
