&=\lim_{n\to\infty}\operatorname{diag}\left(\gamma_{S}(w_{n})_{i_{1}}(x),\gamma_{S}(w_{n})_{i_{2}}(h^{\beta_{1}}(x)),\ldots,\gamma_{S}(w_{n})_{i_{q}}(h^{\beta_{q-1}}(x))\right)\\
